nd interest. On the typical day ₹551 per quintal was left.","camera":"corridor","focus":[1026,1096],"route":"palayam-chala","chart":"waterfall"},{"kind":"stress","headline":"Still positive under stress","caption":"With 25% dearer freight, 10% loss and costlier credit, the typical day still kept ₹329 per quintal.","camera":"corridor","focus":[1026,1096],"route":"palayam-chala","chart":"waterfall"},{"kind":"strategy","headline":"A trader who only knew the morning's news","caption":"Using only the latest available Chala report, the rule selects 19 of 25 modeled shipping days. 19 had positive modeled net, averaging ₹648 per quintal (₹433 under stress).","camera":"corridor","focus":[1026,1096],"route":"palayam-chala","chart":"strategy"},{"kind":"conclusion","headline":"The back-test","caption":"The modeled Cluster beans route from Palayam to Chala was positive on 84% of matched days in December 2022. At that average, a 100-quintal (10-tonne) load implies ₹64,800, or ₹43,300 under stress. Actual buyer, capacity, haggling, rejection and delays are unknown.","camera":"corridor","focus":[1026,1096],"route":"palayam-chala"}],"assumptions":[{"kind":"sourced","item":"Freight","value":"≈₹240 per quintal Nashik→Delhi","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Freight for this product","value":"onion survey freight applied per quintal to cluster beans","source":null},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Freight on other distances","value":"scaled by road km against the 1,115 km Lasalgaon→Azadpur route → ₹82/qtl here","source":null},{"kind":"sourced","item":"Mandi fee + commission","value":"1% + 4% of purchase value","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"sourced","item":"Loading/unloading","value":"₹9.02 per quintal","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Weight & quality loss in transit","value":"5% baseline, 10% adverse","source":null},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Working capital","value":"12% a year (14% adverse) for transit + 7 days","sour